bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    per_file_lane_unit_mir_physical_ownership_missing_hir_2026-11-12, 0, "2026-11-12 OPEN. Default per-file lane (SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS unset) cannot build: unit child MIR physical-ownership gate (driver_pipeline_lowering.spl:840-861) requires HIR for the whole frozen inventory, but a unit holds only its batch. 3-file repro: 'MIR physical ownership missing HIR for app.p3rp.main'. Stage 3 shape fails in 6 min on leaf units. Workaround SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS=0 (capsule-shard route). Secondary: worker_hir_profile_v1 rejects --mode and SIMPLE_FILE_WORKERS/RUST_LOG env at threads>=2. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/per_file_lane_unit_mir_physical_ownership_missing_hir_2026-11-12.md."

